{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_073C10","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Pupa通过喷射压缩空气让机体后部浮起，以提高机动性。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"推进时则把履带和助推器结合使用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那种高速突进的动作，就是靠助推器完成的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"破坏助推器，就能阻止它突进？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"没错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过，突进时只要匍匐钻到Pupa下面，应该也能躲开……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"啊，还有，Pupa装备了电击装置。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":43,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"它还装有类似避雷针的东西，用来引导电击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那最好在它放电之前就先破坏掉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"对。还有一点是AI驱动机械的共同弱点：只要破坏AI，它就无法行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"只要撬开舱门进入内部，就能拔掉AI的记忆板。那样就好办了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"那些记忆板说不定还能再利用。如果有机会，就试着进入AI Pod。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不过，首先得造成一定伤害让它停下来，否则连进去都做不到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"明白。先按正面打法来吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""}]}